# desc: 근거 묶음이 둘 이상인 판단 — 「A 단독 또는 A·B 결합」처럼 선택적 근거를 제시한 것은? (결손 alternative-grounds)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT ?j (COUNT(DISTINCT ?set) AS ?alternatives)
WHERE { ?j a pa:ExaminerJudgment ; pa:supportedBy ?set . }
GROUP BY ?j
HAVING (COUNT(DISTINCT ?set) >= 2)
ORDER BY ?j
